# Runtime / intermediate artifacts of the voice-turn-detection comparison harness.
# The EVIDENCE is committed: RESULT.json, manifest.json, dataset-sources.json, the adapters and the
# oracle SCRIPT. The entries below are regenerated on every run and are not evidence.

# numpy-oracle work dir: run.mts writes items.json + per-sample f32 feature dumps here. The oracle
